[{"answer":"Morning, Myra.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hi, Arthur!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/2.mp3"},{"answer":"You're taking Ecology Three Eleven too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Looks like it. It's my only elective this term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Really? What happened?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I just took too many my second year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and now I've got to pick up all the required courses I've been ignoring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/7.mp3"},{"answer":"University's just too much fun, I guess.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Too many parties?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/9.mp3"},{"answer":"No. Well, yeah, that too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/10.mp3"},{"answer":"But you know, there're just so many interesting things to learn about,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and we've only got four years here to explore them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been having too good a time at it, that's all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/13.mp3"},{"answer":"But it has helped me decide my major, finally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/14.mp3"},{"answer":"And?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Business Ad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I've learned a lot here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and one thing I've learned is that most fields don't hold out a lot of promise for gainful employment!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So I'm playing it safe and going for my BA in business administration.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/19.mp3"},{"answer":"So, why Three Eleven?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/20.mp3"},{"answer":"An ecology course isn't going to help you in your office job at some corporation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Probably not, but it still seems interesting and important.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/22.mp3"},{"answer":"We all need to know about the environment, no matter what we do for a living.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, you're right. And maybe you will be able to use it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe you'll end up working for a green company or something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Could be. There's more and more of those every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/26.mp3"},{"answer":"And thank goodness. Poor old Earth!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that why you're taking this?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's not an elective for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I need Three Eleven for my BS program.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/30.mp3"},{"answer":"We need several cross-field courses to \"broaden our understanding\",","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and this is one of them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, though, I'm looking forward to this course:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/33.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Nature's Influence on Man - Man's Influence on Nature\"!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds like a really useful topic, doesn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/35.mp3"},{"answer":"And Dr Forsythe is supposed to be a very engaging lecturer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, his website is a gas, at least!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/37.mp3"},{"answer":"He's got a hilarious little eco-game on it:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/38.mp3"},{"answer":"shoot the wolves and see how many deer reproduce and eat all the grass!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. I suppose that would teach, uh, fifth graders about the balance of nature.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Hey, it was fun!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, he's also got some good information there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/42.mp3"},{"answer":"it'll probably come in handy when he gives us homework.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, you're right!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I better take a look at it myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you give me his URL?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It's listed right in the course guide where they describe the course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/47.mp3"},{"answer":"but if you can't find it, I'll give it to you next time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Or I could email it to you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/49.mp3"},{"answer":"what's your address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/50.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be great, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/51.mp3"},{"answer":"myrasweetie@umail.com","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Here, I'll write it down for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you pick up your textbook yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/54.mp3"},{"answer":"No. I've been looking for a secondhand copy before I spring for a new one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/55.mp3"},{"answer":"It's expensive - forty-five bucks!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/56.mp3"},{"answer":"They all are, aren't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Why do poor college students have to pay so much for their textbooks?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It ain't fair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/59.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just economics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Nobody reads them except the students that take the courses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/61.mp3"},{"answer":"The publishers probably didn't print more than a few hundred copies of our text, you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Still, they could print them in paperback, couldn't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/63.mp3"},{"answer":"That would save us some money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/64.mp3"},{"answer":"And on newsprint, sure!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Some students do keep them, though, for reference after they graduate,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/66.mp3"},{"answer":"if they're working in that field.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/67.mp3"},{"answer":"In that case, they need to be durable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/68.mp3"},{"answer":"My dad's still got his college accounting textbooks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and he uses them all the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Where you gonna find a used copy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/72.mp3"},{"answer":"At the bookstore?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/73.mp3"},{"answer":"They don't have any there now, I checked.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I put up some notes on the Science Building bulletin boards yesterday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe someone there's got one they don't want to keep anymore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, uh, if you hear about two of them, will you let me know?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to save a little money, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/79.mp3"},{"answer":"If I do, I'll buy it for you and you can pay me back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/80.mp3"},{"answer":"How much are you willing to pay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, anything under $35 will be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/82.mp3"},{"answer":"A penny saved is a penny earned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/83.mp3"},{"answer":"But if you haven't found one by next Monday, I'll have to buy a new one then,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/84.mp3"},{"answer":"so email me Sunday night either way, will you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/85.mp3"},{"answer":"You bet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Oops! Here's Dr Forsythe now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-2-2023-01-13-22-57-13/87.mp3"}]
